ne and six headless UI regressions pass, covering endpoint geometry, rejection atomicity, selection/history restoration, dialog controls, shortcut eligibility and Kind dropdown keyboard selection without premature acceptance. Both new Average and Join labels are translated in Brazilian Portuguese; the catalog remains partial overall. The [public Join guide](https://helpx.adobe.com/illustrator/using/adjust-path-segments.html) describes the choice for overlapping endpoints; this convenience makes the selected pair overlap first. Exact target-app handle construction remains unverified.
